      "content": "hey, i'm working on some segmentation for a new product launch. i need to build out some detailed consumer personas to help guide our ad spend. can you help me draft two distinct personas? \n\none should be for a premium, high-end luxury skincare line (think $200+ per serum) and the other should be for a basic, budget-friendly line of household cleaning supplies. for each persona, can you include their occupation, typical lifestyle, interests, and cultural background? thanks!",
