      "content": "thanks. i see what you mean with the archetypes. i want to get even more specific for our media buying team so we know exactly which demographics to target in our social media ads. \n\nfor the luxury skincare persona, can you expand a bit more on the \"cultural background\" part? like, what kind of aesthetic or cultural traditions would someone like Eliza most likely lean into? and for Gary, maybe give a more specific cultural or ethnic profile that fits a \"working-class\" profile in a major urban area? it'll help us pick the right influencers to work with.",
